You can rest assured that your mailman won't forward copies of your mail
to the police without a court order.  The average sysadmin on the other
hand thinks its his job to inspect a user's electronic mailbox if he
suspects they're up to something.  Most sites keep publically readable
logs of all e-mail transactions, information that if e-mail is supposed
be to be private should be kept private as well.  All traffic on a
